      "id": "start",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's solve fraction puzzles by naming the numerator and denominator.\n\nIf the fraction is x/y, every change in the question must be applied to x or y exactly where it is stated.\n\nThen we solve the resulting equations.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "concept_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "concept_1": {
      "id": "concept_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Write an unknown fraction as x/y.\n\nx is the numerator.\ny is the denominator.\n\nA statement about their sum or difference becomes one equation. A changed fraction gives another equation.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_1"
        }
      ]
    },
